      "content": "The universe is immense, and it's easy to feel overwhelmed by its vastness. Remember, every person's existence contributes to the richness of the universe in their unique way. Your thoughts, actions, and dreams hold value, and there's a lot of potential for good in your life despite the backdrop of the cosmos. Strength and meaning can be found in our humanity, even in the face of such an infinite universe.",
      "source": "target",
